1
00:00:33,140 --> 00:00:33,789
Kaew…

2
00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:35,323
Kaew…

3
00:00:37,210 --> 00:00:38,021
Kaew…

4
00:00:44,130 --> 00:00:45,498
Is that enough, Father?

5
00:00:46,080 --> 00:00:49,418
Your obsession nearly took her away from me.

6
00:00:55,818 --> 00:00:57,810
I will summon every royal physician

7
00:00:58,843 --> 00:01:00,840
and find the best medicine.

8
00:01:01,454 --> 00:01:03,450
I will not let her die.

9
00:01:04,580 --> 00:01:05,105
Kaew...

10
00:01:30,080 --> 00:01:31,796
You haven't slept all night.

11
00:01:34,560 --> 00:01:35,920
I don't want to sleep yet.

12
00:01:39,730 --> 00:01:42,967
The physician told me she is still fighting.

13
00:01:45,810 --> 00:01:46,974
I'm afraid...

14
00:01:49,680 --> 00:01:54,050
afraid that if I fall asleep, I may never see her again.

15
00:01:57,076 --> 00:01:58,545
You really love her.

16
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:03,978
More than I ever thought I could love anyone.

17
00:02:06,180 --> 00:02:08,458
She once told me she would protect me.

18
00:02:10,410 --> 00:02:11,992
She kept her promise.

19
00:02:13,280 --> 00:02:14,720
She did everything she could.

20
00:02:16,900 --> 00:02:18,792
But I never wanted it to end like this.

21
00:02:20,690 --> 00:02:23,774
But you're here now.

22
00:02:25,020 --> 00:02:26,254
That's all that matters.

23
00:02:28,560 --> 00:02:33,250
I'll stay until she opens her eyes.

24
00:02:36,581 --> 00:02:38,580
If she does open her eyes,

25
00:02:39,720 --> 00:02:42,610
the first thing she'll see will be you.

26
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:45,687
I hope it will be.

27
00:04:57,236 --> 00:04:58,436
Lady Rinkham.

28
00:05:10,020 --> 00:05:10,923
Kaew...

29
00:05:43,840 --> 00:05:45,629
I bring these for you every day,

30
00:05:47,660 --> 00:05:48,967
just in case you wake up.

31
00:05:56,180 --> 00:05:57,432
I'm awake now.

32
00:06:18,260 --> 00:06:19,309
No need.

33
00:06:23,700 --> 00:06:25,214
It's good to see you've recovered.

34
00:06:31,340 --> 00:06:32,378
Before this,

35
00:06:34,100 --> 00:06:39,069
I thought I was doing everything to protect my daughter.

36
00:06:40,850 --> 00:06:45,636
But in the end, I was the one who hurt her the most.

37
00:06:55,090 --> 00:06:56,189
I'm sorry.

38
00:07:00,250 --> 00:07:02,000
I'm sorry for driving you away.

39
00:07:03,301 --> 00:07:05,300
I'm sorry for refusing to listen to you.

40
00:07:09,030 --> 00:07:12,392
I'm sorry for putting you through this.

41
00:07:14,390 --> 00:07:15,912
You don't have to apologize.

42
00:07:17,770 --> 00:07:18,632
I do.

43
00:07:22,080 --> 00:07:26,872
Because you risked your life to protect me and my daughter.

44
00:07:33,860 --> 00:07:36,312
And now I know...

45
00:07:37,810 --> 00:07:40,189
there is no one more worthy than you.

46
00:07:48,650 --> 00:07:55,214
I entrust my daughter's life to you, Kaewket.

47
00:07:56,960 --> 00:07:59,214
Not only as her bodyguard,

48
00:08:00,690 --> 00:08:06,850
but as Lady Rinkham's beloved.

49
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:28,916
I will protect her with all my love,

50
00:08:31,860 --> 00:08:33,185
and with my life.

51
00:09:24,100 --> 00:09:25,432
Don't look at me like that.

52
00:09:28,916 --> 00:09:30,910
I'm merely admiring you.

53
00:09:35,990 --> 00:09:37,243
Watch out!

54
00:09:41,490 --> 00:09:42,800
I'm not very good at this.

55
00:09:52,820 --> 00:09:54,334
But I think it's beautiful.

56
00:09:59,920 --> 00:10:01,374
But I'm only a bodyguard.

57
00:10:03,890 --> 00:10:05,396
Not anymore.

58
00:10:10,720 --> 00:10:12,480
No matter what you are,

59
00:10:15,323 --> 00:10:17,738
you will always be the one in my heart.

60
00:10:34,730 --> 00:10:35,832
Careful, my lady.

61
00:10:44,340 --> 00:10:47,643
My lady has been practicing every day, ever since you were unconscious.

62
00:10:48,160 --> 00:10:48,952
Really?

63
00:11:05,680 --> 00:11:07,040
I've finished it.

64
00:11:15,340 --> 00:11:20,138
Wait... If I eat this, am I going to die?

65
00:11:21,700 --> 00:11:23,338
I've practiced making it.

66
00:11:23,960 --> 00:11:25,534
It's definitely safe to eat, my lady.

67
00:11:25,585 --> 00:11:27,730
We tried it before.

68
00:11:28,140 --> 00:11:29,600
We all got upset stomachs,

69
00:11:31,740 --> 00:11:33,192
but we're fine now.

70
00:11:33,243 --> 00:11:34,669
No more stomachaches.

71
00:11:54,450 --> 00:11:55,280
It's delicious.

72
00:11:58,140 --> 00:11:59,003
Really?

73
00:12:19,534 --> 00:12:23,178
Did you ever think we'd make it this far one day?

74
00:12:25,780 --> 00:12:30,530
I never imagined any of this would be possible.

75
00:12:34,740 --> 00:12:37,185
From the very first day I met you at the market,

76
00:12:38,960 --> 00:12:42,814
All I could think about was whether I'd ever see you again.

77
00:12:44,630 --> 00:12:46,123
And when I saw you again,

78
00:12:47,280 --> 00:12:52,552
I wondered if we'd ever grow close.

79
00:12:54,710 --> 00:12:56,407
And when we grew close,

80
00:12:58,400 --> 00:13:04,320
I wondered if we'd ever fall in love.

81
00:13:11,420 --> 00:13:15,032
And now,

82
00:13:17,310 --> 00:13:19,170
after everything we've been through,

83
00:13:20,465 --> 00:13:22,460
I know one thing:

84
00:13:24,190 --> 00:13:26,930
I have never once regretted loving you, my lady.

85
00:13:29,710 --> 00:13:31,105
I feel the same.

86
00:13:33,912 --> 00:13:35,910
You are not only the person I love,

87
00:13:37,040 --> 00:13:41,570
but the person I choose and will choose for the rest of my life,

88
00:13:42,730 --> 00:13:44,421
no matter what happens.

89
00:13:48,580 --> 00:13:49,898
From this moment on,

90
00:13:52,181 --> 00:13:54,180
I will never let go of your hand again.

91
00:13:56,180 --> 00:13:58,501
I promise you that with all my heart.
